# PredictActionChunk — passive policy inference on demand.
#
# Request carries the observation frame to infer from.
# Response returns a flattened denormalized action chunk:
#   actions layout = row-major (chunk_size, action_dim)
#   3-DoF policies → action_dim = 4
#   6-DoF policies → action_dim = 7

cloudgripper_msgs/ObsFrame frame
---
bool success
string message
float32[] actions
int32 chunk_size
int32 action_dim
